          "line_end": 88,
          "line_start": 87,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "qwenlm/qwen-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen-Agent/blob/31a4d36d123688581a9e9744427272b33ce940e0/README.md#L87-L88"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d99bc5e47d12ab506ff820f7576ff2bc5bae7396c7b49536b66992e8c921d01d"
      ],
      "text": "The framework provides atomic components — LLMs inheriting from BaseChatModel and Tools inheriting from BaseTool — plus higher-level Agents derived from class Agent."
    },
